  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square four panel painting of a mirrored crowd of round cartoon creatures with white horns, in orange, pink, teal and lilac washes with thick black outlines.",
    "description": "A square painting on four joined wood panels with visible seams. The composition is mirrored left to right around a warm centre: a column of red, orange and pink creatures with white horns and visors runs down the middle, with teal, blue, lilac and lime creatures at the sides. Each creature has a single eye, white tabs and dots, and the colour is laid in overlapping translucent washes with thick black outlines. A purple round face sits at upper centre, blue globes at the right and left edges.",
    "impression": "A second fold of the crowd, warmer in the middle than the first, as if the heat of the crowd gathered at its heart. The twins stare at each other across the seam. It feels like a kaleidoscope paused.",
